5, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids February to March, July to August, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 166% of normal for March to April and 68% for November to December. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 45% and May to June at 170%. Grids 22073, 22373 and 22673 all had their driest year in 1953.</p>"}
